<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIAN CUP QUARTER-FINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIAN CUP QUARTER-FINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-final</p>
<p>matches in the Romanian Cup on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Steaua Bucharest (I)	3 FC Petrolul Ploiesti (I) 2</p>
<p>(sudden death extra time, 2-2 after 90 minutes)</p>
<p> Dinamo Bucharest (I)	4 CSM Resita (II)	    1</p>
<p> Universitatea Craiova (I) 2 FC Brasov (I)		0</p>
<p> FC National Bucharest (I) 3 Universitatea Cluj (I)   1</p>
